Upgrading prerequisite software (Upgrading from Version 5.1 to Version 5.3)
Last Updated: 2026-07-15

Several services have prerequisite software that must be upgraded by a cluster administrator.

Upgrade phase

        You are not here. Collecting required information
        You are not here. Updating your client workstation
        You are not here. Preparing to run an upgrade in a restricted network
