Who needs to complete this task?

    Cluster administrator A cluster administrator must update the prerequisite software on the cluster.
When do you need to complete this task?

    Complete the appropriate tasks if your environment includes any of the services that need the prerequisite software.
    One-time setup You must complete this task if you upgrade your cluster and need to upgrade the prerequisite software to maintain compatibility with:

        The version of Red Hat® OpenShift® Container Platform that you are running.
        The version of IBM® Software Hub that you plan to upgrade to.

About this task

The prerequisite software that you must upgrade depends on the services on your environment. Use the following table to determine which prerequisite software you need to upgrade:
