    The version of the Red Hat OpenShift Serverless Operator on your cluster is out of support.

Procedure

Update the appropriate prerequisite software on your cluster.

    Upgrading operators for services that require GPUs(Upgrading from Version 5.1 to Version 5.3)
    If your environment includes services that require GPUs, you might need to upgrade the NVIDIA GPU Operator and the Node Feature Discovery Operator.
    Upgrading Red Hat OpenShift AI (Upgrading from Version 5.1 to Version 5.3)
    If your environment includes services with a dependency on Red Hat OpenShift AI, you might need to upgrade the Red Hat OpenShift AI Operator before you upgrade IBM Software Hub.
    Upgrading Multicloud Object Gateway for IBM Software Hub (Upgrading from Version 5.1 to Version 5.3)
    If your environment includes services with a dependency on Multicloud Object Gateway, you might need to upgrade Multicloud Object Gateway before you upgrade IBM Software Hub.

